    ],
    "text": "MINIMUM AGE OF MARRIAGE",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      174.81,
      422.81,
      415.55,
      434.15
    ],
    "text": "to introduce the Minimum Age of Marriage in Sri Lanka",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      228.33,
      166.97,
      401.69,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "1Minimum Age of Marriage",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.05,
      204.17,
      385.77,
      215.51
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INTRODUCE THE MINIMUM AGE OF MARRIAGE",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      258.21,
      217.97,
      305.48,
      229.31
    ],
    "text": "IN SRI LANKA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      245.57,
      401.9,
      339.71
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the child or underage marriage is an infringementof a young person\u2019s right to education, development andsecurity and as such is considered a serious social evil thatmay render vulnerable the children of Sri Lanka to forms ofphysical or mental violence, injury or abuse, neglect ornegligent treatment, maltreatment or exploitation, includingsexual abuse:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      355.97,
      401.9,
      408.71
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS that Sri Lanka guarantees equal protection of thelaw to all its people regardless of age, race, religion, language,caste, sex, political opinion, place of birth or any one ofsuch grounds:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      424.97,
      401.9,
      477.71
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the duty of the State owed to future generationsto ensure that such future generations have the opportunityto learn, develop and grow to become a better and moreprosperous society: and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      493.97,
      401.91,
      588.11
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS of this Act to afford to all persons under the ageof eighteen all possible protection of the law and to ensurethat no person shall consent or decide on their behalf to enterthem into a marriage and to introduce measures for the relevantorgans of the State give full effect to the spirit and letter ofthis Act and thereby convey that the State is committed tothe elimination of child marriage:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      604.37,
      401.95,
      629.51
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      645.77,
      401.86,
      670.91
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Minimum Age ofMarriage Act, No. of 2020.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      246.07,
      442.29,
      255.14
    ],
    "text": "Preamble.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      647.11,
      443.86,
      656.18
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      147.57,
      300.89,
      152.57,
      312.23
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.29,
      382.97,
      154.29,
      394.31
    ],
    "text": "10",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      144.57,
      466.49,
      155.01,
      477.83
    ],
    "text": "15",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      144.57,
      547.97,
      155.01,
      559.31
    ],
    "text": "20",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      144.57,
      645.41,
      155.01,
      656.75
    ],
    "text": "25",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      166.97,
      331.15,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "2Minimum Age of Marriage",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.97,
      397.18,
      238.31
    ],
    "text": "2.No marriage contracted after the coming into force ofthis Act shall be valid unless both parties to the marriagehave completed eighteen years of age.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      250.97,
      397.18,
      298.31
    ],
    "text": "3.(i) Every child marriage, whether solemnised beforeor after the commencement of this Act, shall be voidable atthe option of the contracting party who was a child at thetime of the marriage;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      310.97,
      397.25,
      370.31
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Provided that an application for annulling a childmarriage by a decree of nullity may be filed in the DistrictCourt in the local jurisdiction in which the applicant residesand by only a contracting party to the marriage who waschild at the time of the marriage;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      382.97,
      397.2,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "(iii) If at the time of filing an application, the applicant isa minor, the application may be filed through his or herguardian or next friend;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      430.97,
      397.2,
      466.31
    ],
    "text": "(iv) The application under this section may be filed at anytime but before the child filing the application completestwo years of attaining majority;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      478.97,
      397.2,
      538.31
    ],
    "text": "(v) Every application under this section shall be made inwriting and shall be signed by the applicant or the personmaking the application on his behalf and shall be free of anystamp duty. Every summons to a respondent or a witnessshall also be free of stamp duty;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      550.97,
      397.15,
      574.31
    ],
    "text": "(vi) Once an application is filed and Court is satisfied onthe application that\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      586.97,
      397.2,
      610.31
    ],
    "text": "(a) the applicant had not reached the age of 18 at thetime the marriage was registered; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      622.97,
      322.88,
      634.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) that the marriage was registered,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      646.97,
      397.18,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "the Court shall make grant a decree of nullity of suchmarriage;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      142.51,
      262.97,
      147.51,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      333.89,
      150.31,
      345.23
    ],
    "text": "10",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
