    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      562.97,
      150.31,
      574.31
    ],
    "text": "25",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      203.11,
      437.6,
      231.38
    ],
    "text": "Minimumage iseighteen.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      251.83,
      448.88,
      328.1
    ],
    "text": "Childmarriages tobe voidableat theoption ofcontractingparty being achild.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      658.97,
      150.31,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "30",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      228.33,
      166.97,
      401.69,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "3Minimum Age of Marriage",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      147.45,
      255.77,
      152.45,
      267.11
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      144.45,
      328.97,
      154.89,
      340.31
    ],
    "text": "10",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      144.45,
      405.89,
      154.89,
      417.23
    ],
    "text": "15",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      144.45,
      480.89,
      154.89,
      492.23
    ],
    "text": "20",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      144.45,
      557.45,
      154.89,
      568.79
    ],
    "text": "25",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      144.45,
      631.97,
      154.89,
      643.31
    ],
    "text": "30",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      203.33,
      401.95,
      302.87
    ],
    "text": "(vii) While granting a decree of nullity under this section,the Court shall make an order directing both the partiesto the marriage and their parents or their guardians to returnto the other party, his or her parents or guardian, as thecase may be, the money, valuables, ornaments and othergifts received on the occasion of the marriage by them fromthe other side, or an amount equal to the value of suchvaluables, ornaments, other gifts and money:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      316.73,
      401.88,
      365.87
    ],
    "text": "Provided that no order under this section shall be executedunless the concerned parties have been given notices toappear before the Court and show cause why such ordershould not be passed;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      379.73,
      401.9,
      454.07
    ],
    "text": "(viii) Where there are children born of the child marriage,the Court shall make an appropriate order for the custody ofsuch children. While making an order for the custody of achild under this section, the welfare and best interests of thechild shall be the paramount consideration to be given bythe Court;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      467.93,
      401.89,
      529.67
    ],
    "text": "(ix) An order for custody of a child may also includeappropriate directions for giving to the other party access tothe child in such a manner as may best serve the interest ofthe child, and such other orders as the Court may, in theinterest of the child, deem proper;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      543.53,
      401.88,
      580.07
    ],
    "text": "(x) The Court may also make an appropriate order forproviding maintenance to the child by a party to the marriageor their parents or guardians.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      593.93,
      401.91,
      668.27
    ],
    "text": "4.Notwithstanding that a child marriage has beenannulled by a decree of nullity under section 3, every childbegotten or conceived such marriage before the decree ismade, whether born before or after the commencement ofthis Act, shall be deemed to be a legitimate child for allpurposes.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      595.39,
      454.3,
      633.26
    ],
    "text": "Legitimacyof childrenborn of childmarriages.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      166.97,
      331.15,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "4Minimum Age of Marriage",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      169.15,
      202.73,
      238.99,
      214.07
    ],
    "text": "5.In this Act\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      196.87,
      226.13,
      397.17,
      249.23
    ],
    "text": "(a)\u201cchild\u201d means, any person who has notattained the age of eighteen;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      196.87,
      261.29,
      397.19,
      284.27
    ],
    "text": "(b)\u201cchild marriage\u201d means, a marriage to whicheither one or both party is a child;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      197.71,
      296.33,
      397.18,
      354.95
    ],
    "text": "(c)\u201cmarriage\u201d means, any marriage, includingmarriages contracted under and by virtue ofthe Kandyan Marriage and Divorce Act,No. 44 of 1952 as amended and marriagescontracted between persons professing Islam;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
