      367.73,
      397.19,
      426.23
    ],
    "text": "(d)\u201cregistrar\u201d means, any District Registrar orDivisional Registrar as appointed in terms ofthe Marriage Registration Ordinance,Kandyan Marriage and Divorce Act and theMuslim Marriage and Divorce Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
